  "title": "Challah Bread",
  "description": "This challah recipe makes a beautiful braided Jewish egg bread with yeast that&#39;s sweetened with honey and topped with poppy seeds.",
  "authors": [
    "Joan Callaway"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-06-16T14:23:03-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-03-04T16:55:24-05:00",
  "prep_time": "PT30M",
  "cook_time": "PT40M",
  "total_time": "PT220M",
  "yield": [
    "30",
    "2 braided loaves"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Bread"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "Kosher"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "Kosher"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [
    "publisher-tested"
  ],
  "ingredients": [
    "2.5 cups warm water (110 degrees F/45 degrees C)",
    "1 tablespoon active dry yeast",
    "0.5 cup honey",
    "4 tablespoons vegetable oil",
    "3 eggs, divided",
    "1 tablespoon salt",
    "8 cups unbleached all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon poppy seeds"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pD7hD_lGFH8h793_VZMFpKgE1Xk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-6760-challah-step-01-2f5f022f90b14a3eaf789eba2ea58cb5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6760/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour warm water into a large bowl; sprinkle yeast over water. Let stand until yeast softens and begins to form a creamy foam, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i8lhTIU3gYX98ztbDOWTgo7wUSg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-6760-challah-step-02-a42fe8f662b4405b9763d5fe78ee3b8b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6760/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat in honey, oil, 2 eggs, and salt. Add flour, 1 cup at a time, beating after each addition until dough has pulled together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/L2AExzHJUTMtGAYxuc98Q2enjLc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-6760-challah-step-03-3717595cc043403d9c9bc89c32c1553f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6760/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn it out onto a lightly floured surface and knead until smooth and elastic.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wxpqlAsVvsXDuEgPzhyYyQq62ww=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-6760-challah-step-04-21feb7f4306e45b3b83161fab66965b8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6760/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place dough in a large, lightly-oiled bowl and turn to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/A21L9PyQPQ5GUreod-wuXqHXP68=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-6760-challah-step-05-c4467ea42b964196be50de31771d658a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6760/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover with a towel and let rise in a warm place until doubled in volume, about 1 ½ hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NW0X1b-CDcvZDrXn5KUWzhiaTXo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-6760-challah-step-06-6150fad289294a12873a8e8031b1ae3c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6760/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Punch down dough and turn onto a lightly floured surface. Divide in half and knead each half for 5 minutes or so, adding flour as needed to keep it from getting sticky.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TAL9w1w8w__joEQ_y_55ltBZoTE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-6760-challah-step-07-31858fe0f36e4790acb01110afed0fc0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6760/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide each half into thirds and roll into a long snake about 1 ½ inches in diameter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eh7FN8iSPrFTA2112o7pv7VoNO8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-6760-challah-step-08-88cf8c0d4a93496c85c44e69f948fc9e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6760/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pinch the ends of the three snakes together firmly and braid from middle. Either leave as a braid or form into a round braided loaf by bringing ends together, curving the braid into a circle, and pinching ends together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Zr8Fm3X42Q4qAxDbb7UppcWmPIg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-6760-challah-step-09-431e998523e04d3ebb8969dd7413b8a4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6760/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grease two baking trays and place the finished braid or round on each. Cover with a towel and let rise for about 1 hour. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zkxWMTzc8SMATf7IYS4UIQjL4H8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-6760-challah-step-10-095de577f60746ea88b0db7d64ce5da0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6760/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat the remaining egg and brush a generous amount over each braid; sprinkle with poppy seeds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6TbCFVmgQa20cczWLbuo3ZDNxhE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-6760-challah-step-12-45ff4c52f3fd4cf897e4677b84fdb2f4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6760/step_11.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in preheated oven until golden brown, about 40 minutes. Cool on a wire rack for at least one hour before slicing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LGuvHnagxWOv22HGgMPEfSDwpto=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-6760-challah-step-13-e7a291bc54db4251981c068578023e90.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6760/step_12.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/W3RU_XU0b3sPpOF3y2j8dsewYZQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6760-challah-VAT-Beauty-4x3-1f0f88d40b5c4492b496171082ac33b8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6760/step_13.webp"
    }
  ],
